</b></div></div><!--]--></div></section></div><div id="ce4e8520-2033-4543-821e-f6ef8d2dae1f" data-v-636a5a88><section class="box workshop workshop--odd" data-v-636a5a88 data-v-c4f127a2><div class="box__container" data-v-c4f127a2><!--[--><div class="presentationBox presentationBox--odd" data-v-636a5a88 data-v-54791b94><div class="presentationBox__header" data-v-54791b94><h2 class="presentationBox__title" data-v-54791b94>The Model Picks the Component: How Generative UI Works</h2><div class="presentationBox__infoGroup" data-v-54791b94><div class="speakers" data-v-54791b94 data-v-332e3a7f><!--[--><div class="speaker" data-v-332e3a7f><div class="container speaker__photo" data-v-332e3a7f data-v-21067a46><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIl5cSkRQHSqYkhQbGfEu210KIDkYHfKSIbQA0xZW87xfmGzcGJxw" class="image" loading="lazy" data-v-21067a46></div><div class="speaker__name" data-v-332e3a7f><span data-v-332e3a7f>Georgios</span><span data-v-332e3a7f> Diamantopoulos</span></div></div><!--]--></div><div class="presentationMetadata presentationBox__metadata" data-v-54791b94 data-v-fbcdb3fd><div class="presentationMetadata__group" data-v-fbcdb3fd><i class="presentationMetadata__icon fas fa-flag" title="language" data-v-fbcdb3fd></i><div class="presentationMetadata__language" data-v-fbcdb3fd>English</div></div><div class="presentationMetadata__group" data-v-fbcdb3fd><i class="presentationMetadata__icon fas fa-graduation-cap" title="level" data-v-fbcdb3fd></i><div class="presentationMetadata__level" data-v-fbcdb3fd>Intermediate</div></div><div class="presentationMetadata__group" data-v-fbcdb3fd><i class="presentationMetadata__icon fas fa-clock" title="workshop duration" data-v-fbcdb3fd></i><div class="presentationMetadata__duration" data-v-fbcdb3fd>120 min</div></div><div class="presentationMetadata__group" data-v-fbcdb3fd><i class="presentationMetadata__icon fas fa-users" title="participants limit" data-v-fbcdb3fd></i><div class="presentationMetadata__maxGroupSize" data-v-fbcdb3fd>max 20</div></div><div class="presentationMetadata__group" data-v-fbcdb3fd><!--[--><i class="presentationMetadata__icon fas fa-tags" title="tags" data-v-fbcdb3fd></i><div class="presentationMetadata__tags" data-v-fbcdb3fd><!--[--><span class="presentationMetadata__tag" data-v-fbcdb3fd>Artificial Intelligence</span><!--]--></div><!--]--></div></div></div></div><!--[--><!--]--><div class="presentationBox__description" data-v-54791b94><p>  AI features often compute a structured answer, then flatten it into a wall of markdown. Generative UI lets the
  model answer with interface: tables, metrics, diagrams, and actions chosen for the user’s question.</p>
<p>  We’ll follow that answer from intent to rendered component: a model selects from a developer-owned registry, fills
  a typed schema, and streams structured blocks that the client validates and renders. A working demo will show the
  pattern in action, including interactive responses that feed back into the conversation. We’ll close with the
  judgment behind the architecture: when a component improves an answer, when prose is better, and how much freedom
  the model should get.</p>
<p><b>Required at workshop:</p>
<ul>
   <li>laptop with an access to agentic coding (Claude Code/Codex)</li>
   <li>You can also join as a spectator, simply observing the trainer.</li>
</ul>
</b></div></div><!--]--></div></section></div><div id="2ecc58c0-a2fe-453f-bdab-ebf89c1b21d9" data-v-636a5a88><section class="box workshop" data-v-636a5a88 data-v-c4f127a2><div class="box__container" data-v-c4f127a2><!--[--><div class="presentationBox" data-v-636a5a88 data-v-54791b94><div class="presentationBox__header" data-v-54791b94><h2 class="presentationBox__title" data-v-54791b94>Wstęp Wolny - Od pomysłu do wystąpienia. Jak w krótkim czasie zaplanować przemowę.</h2><div class="presentationBox__infoGroup" data-v-54791b94><div class="speakers" data-v-54791b94 data-v-332e3a7f><!--[--><div class="speaker" data-v-332e3a7f><div class="container speaker__photo" data-v-332e3a7f data-v-21067a46><img src="https://resources.confitura.pl/photos/0543481d-80b2-4c56-8cbb-f008aa5f809c.jpg?size=90" class="image" loading="lazy" data-v-21067a46></div><div class="speaker__name" data-v-332e3a7f><span data-v-332e3a7f>Karol</span><span data-v-332e3a7f> Ślasko</span></div></div><!--]--></div><div class="presentationMetadata presentationBox__metadata" data-v-54791b94 data-v-fbcdb3fd><div class="presentationMetadata__group" data-v-fbcdb3fd><i class="presentationMetadata__icon fas fa-flag" title="language" data-v-fbcdb3fd></i><div class="presentationMetadata__language" data-v-fbcdb3fd>Polish</div></div><div class="presentationMetadata__group" data-v-fbcdb3fd><i class="presentationMetadata__icon fas fa-graduation-cap" title="level" data-v-fbcdb3fd></i><div class="presentationMetadata__level" data-v-fbcdb3fd>Beginner</div></div><div class="presentationMetadata__group" data-v-fbcdb3fd><i class="presentationMetadata__icon fas fa-clock" title="workshop duration" data-v-fbcdb3fd></i><div class="presentationMetadata__duration" data-v-fbcdb3fd>120 min</div></div><div class="presentationMetadata__group" data-v-fbcdb3fd><i class="presentationMetadata__icon fas fa-users" title="participants limit" data-v-fbcdb3fd></i><div class="presentationMetadata__maxGroupSize" data-v-fbcdb3fd>max 20</div></div>