e architecture: when a component improves an answer, when prose is better, and how much freedom   the model should get.","  AI features often compute a structured answer, then flatten it into a wall of markdown. Generative UI lets the\n  model answer with interface: tables, metrics, diagrams, and actions chosen for the user’s question.\n\n  We’ll follow that answer from intent to rendered component: a model selects from a developer-owned registry, fills\n  a typed schema, and streams structured blocks that the client validates and renders. A working demo will show the\n  pattern in action, including interactive responses that feed back into the conversation. We’ll close with the\n  judgment behind the architecture: when a component improves an answer, when prose is better, and how much freedom\n  the model should get.\n\n\u003Cb>Required at workshop:\n\u003Cul>\n   \u003Cli>laptop with an access to agentic coding (Claude Code\u002FCodex)\u003C\u002Fli>\n   \u003Cli>You can also join as a spectator, simply observing the trainer.\u003C\u002Fli>\n\u003C\u002Ful>\n\u003C\u002Fb>",120,[164],{"id":19,"name":20},[166],{"id":167,"name":168,"photoUrl":169},"2b55aae0-1e2b-4277-8d3a-8efba29917de","Georgios Diamantopoulos","https:\u002F\u002Flh3.googleusercontent.com\u002Fa\u002FACg8ocIl5cSkRQHSqYkhQbGfEu210KIDkYHfKSIbQA0xZW87xfmGzcGJxw",{"id":171,"title":172,"sortableTitle":173,"shortDescription":174,"description":175,"level":110,"language":12,"workshop":13,"isFree":13,"expectedPrice":14,"durationInMinutes":162,"maxGroupSize":137,"tags":176,"speakers":178},"2ecc58c0-a2fe-453f-bdab-ebf89c1b21d9","Wstęp Wolny - Od pomysłu do wystąpienia. Jak w krótkim czasie zaplanować przemowę.","wstęp wolny - od pomysłu do wystąpienia. jak w krótkim czasie zaplanować przemowę.","Celem warsztatu jest pokazanie, jak przekazywać wiedzę w sposób spójny i zrozumiały podczas wystąpienia. Uczestnicy zastosują poznane narzędzia w praktyce, tworząc szkic (outline) swojego kolejnego wystąpienia.","Więks